abstract: "Defines the AI Foundations Initiative Condition: a behavioral and structural criterion for determining whether an accumulated trajectory is used by a system to originate a consequential next move before the source supplies that move in the present interaction, distinguishing trajectory-constrained participation from preservation, retrieval, and generic proactivity."

